{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15903","headline":"送人 · 王建","name":"送人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白日向西没，黄河复东流。\n人生足着地，宁免四方游。\n我行无返顾，祝子勿回头。\n当须向前去，何用起离忧。\n但恐无广路，平地作山丘。\n令我车与马，欲疾反停留。\n蜀客多积货，边人易封侯。\n男儿恋家乡，欢乐爲仇讐。\n丁宁相劝勉，苦口幸无尤。\n对面无相成，不如豺虎俦。\n彼远不寄书，此寒莫寄裘。\n与君俱绝迹，两念无因由。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}